flowchart TB
    accTitle: Download a paid invoice
    accDescr: Open Billing and select Download. An eligible invoice produces a PDF with the same number. Unavailable invoices get a generic message and generation can be retried.

    billing["Open Billing"] --> download["Select Download"]
    download --> eligible{"Paid invoice for this account?"}
    eligible -->|No| unavailable["Show Invoice unavailable"]
    eligible -->|Yes| generate["Generate PDF with the invoice number"]
    generate --> success{"PDF ready?"}
    success -->|Yes| save["Save the PDF"]
    success -->|No| failure["Show Could not download invoice"]
    failure -->|Retry| eligible
